|champion     = LeBlanc
|skill        = R
|icon         = Mimic.png
|blurb        = {{sbc|Active:}} {{ci|LeBlanc}} casts a mimicked version of her most recent ability, which deals modified damage.
|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''LeBlanc''' casts a mimicked version of her most recently used basic ability, applying the same effects and dealing {{as|'''modified''' magic damage}}.
|icon2        = Mimic Sigil of Malice.png
|description2 = {{sbc|Mimic: Sigil of Malice:}} The orb deals modified damage, while the mark consumption deals double that amount.
|leveling2    = {{st|Orb Magic Damage|{{ap|70 to 230}} {{as|(+ 40% AP)}}|Mark Magic Damage|{{ap|70*2 to 230*2}} {{as|(+ 80% AP)}}|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|70*3 to 230*3}} {{as|(+ 120% AP)}}}}
|icon3        = Mimic Distortion.png
|description3 = {{sbc|Mimic: Distortion:}} Deals modified damage.
|leveling3    = {{st|Magic Damage|{{ap|150 to 480}} {{as|(+ 90% AP)}}}}
|icon4        = Mimic Ethereal Chains.png
|description4 = {{sbc|Mimic: Ethereal Chains:}} The tether's application deals modified damage, while its fracturing deals double that amount.
|leveling4    = {{st|Application Magic Damage|{{ap|70 to 230}} {{as|(+ 40% AP)}}|Fracture Magic Damage|{{ap|70*2 to 230*2}} {{as|(+ 85% AP)}}|Total Magic Damage|{{ap|70*3 to 230*3}} {{as|(+ {{ap|40+85}}% AP)}}}}
|cooldown     = {{ap|45 to 25}}
|queue time   = {{tt|{{fd|0.5}}|Mimic: Distortion initial cast}} / {{tt|{{fd|0.3}}|Mimic: Distortion recast}}
|targeting    = Varied
|affects      = Self
|damagetype   = Magic
|notes        = 
* ''Mimic'' will default to {{ai|Mimic: Sigil of Malice|LeBlanc}} if ''LeBlanc'' ranks up ''Mimic'' without having used any abilities beforehand (even if she has not yet learned {{ai|Sigil of Malice|LeBlanc}}).
* Both {{ai|Mimic: Ethereal Chains|LeBlanc}} and {{ai|Mimic: Sigil of Malice|LeBlanc}} will apply damage twice if the original ability's condition to do so is met.
}}

